Some basic statistics looks very common understandable but in practice and to draw some conclusions it is required both theory and practical experience.

Such as hypothesis testing, Clustering, Churning analysis, Multinomial logistic regression etc.,

In time series: we basically focus on a few algorithms and its characterizes, but more specially, we need to focus
Characteristics of time series
Importance in various fields
Both linear and nonlinear time series
Practical approaches to use and implement time series tools for the specific objectives
Tests, assumptions, theoretical consideration to employ linear or non-linear tools of time series

Regards

Vijay

